{"id":"02536e2efd437c59","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-fixed-point-modal.md","title":"Modal Fixed Point","display":"df-fixed-point-modal — Modal Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","aliases":["89-df-fixed-point-modal"],"display":"df-fixed-point-modal — Modal Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-fixed-point-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-fixed-point-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point-modal — Modal Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8f6cb40eba269af\" href=\"?note=d8f6cb40eba269af\" title=\"89-df-modalized-formula\">89-df-modalized-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d8f6cb40eba269af\" href=\"?note=d8f6cb40eba269af\" title=\"89-df-modalized-formula\">89-df-modalized-formula</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\)</span> is the fixed-point predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是下述定义的二参数不动点集合，逻辑固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(p)\">\\(A(p)\\)</span> : 含命题变元<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>的模态公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> modalized : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>的所有出现都在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>的作用域内</li>\n<li>Members <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> contain no free occurrence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> and satisfy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\">\\(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\\)</span> in GL.</li>\n<li>Since modal propositional syntax has no binders, “no occurrence” and “no free occurrence” coincide here.</li>\n<li>Nonemptiness is the content of the modal fixed-point theorem, not part of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6cb40eba269af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-logic]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6cb40eba269af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}$ and $A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}$ (see [[89-df-modalized-formula]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)$ is the fixed-point predicate (see [[89-df-fixed-point]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mat